Local qualification fixture only; not a Substrate or GKE dependency.
Applies to kubernetes-csi/csi-driver-host-path v1.17.1, commit
c7383ef90bae7803195ede035a7d85ab3c7cffc9.

Keep publication paths unique after worker loss and remove persisted duplicates
through normal NodeUnpublishVolume calls. No manual state repair is required.

